<title>USA: Petrolite Corp Q1 Jan 31 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Petrolite Corp Q1 Jan 31 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.73		    $0.29</p>
<p> Oper net		   8,294		    3,283</p>
<p> Revs			94,058		   88,697</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,357		   11,333</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results from operations and exclude $3,073,000 or $0.27 a share gain on sale of Singapore facility, $2,521,000 or $0.22 a share gain from reversal of Singapore-related currency translation adjustment, and $700,000 or $0.06 a share gain from extending an option to amend its business alliance with Energy Biosystems Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net income after gains $1.28 a share vs $0.29.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
